{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22999","headline":"送韦侍御量移金州司马 · 白居易","name":"送韦侍御量移金州司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春欢雨露同沾泽，冬叹风霜独满衣。\n留滞多时如我少，迁移好处似君稀。\n卧龙云到须先起，蛰燕雷惊尚未飞。\n莫恨东西沟水别，沧溟长短拟同归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}